{"_id":"696197af427c207c885ab793","title":"UNIVERSAL Se Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/76869c003c62c70508e9e4433b4cc67e556fc99ea1ac19b6ac6be2a7eb9e163f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768003503721.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/76869c003c62c70508e9e4433b4cc67e556fc99ea1ac19b6ac6be2a7eb9e163f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768003503721.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-UNIVERSAL-SeHub-83552","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":15592,"executes":16611,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ecbe3e9da7e3053298a03b720242a19a132414c7558ae3a26b4a30acd0f7f2b3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768003503721.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768003503721.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ecbe3e9da7e3053298a03b720242a19a132414c7558ae3a26b4a30acd0f7f2b3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1768003503721.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1768003503721.png"},"likeCount":9,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-01-10T00:05:03.731Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-10T00:05:03.731Z","lastBump":"2026-01-10T00:05:03.731Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/semakind603-droid/SeHub/refs/heads/main/sehub.lua\"))()","features":"WORKING FLING SCRIPT\n\nНИЖЕ ПО РУССКИ\n\nDescription:\nSeHub V2 is a highly customizable script with a focus on smooth UX and premium visuals. It features a fully animated interface with particles, shimmering text, and a robust config system.\n\n✨ Key Features:\n\nCombat: Advanced ESP with Team Check (Green for allies), Health Bars, Boxes, and Glow.\n\nMovement: Camera-based Fly, Air Walk, Noclip, Speed & Jump changers.\n\nFun/Exploits: TP Fling, SpinBot, Fake Lag, and Ghost Invisible (Beta).\n\nWorld: Player Teleports and a custom Waypoint system.\n\n💎 Hidden Features & \"How To Use\":\n\n⚡ Scroll Fly Control:\n\nWhen Fly is enabled, hold Left Ctrl and scroll your Mouse Wheel.\n\nThis adjusts your fly speed in real-time (±3 speed per scroll) without zooming the camera. The UI slider updates automatically!\n\n⌨️ Universal Keybind System:\n\nRight-Click on any toggle button to bind a key.\n\nRight-Click + Backspace to unbind.\n\n📍 Waypoint Hotkeys:\n\nYou can bind specific keys to your saved Waypoints! Just Right-Click the [...] button next to the waypoint.\n\nРУССКИ\n✨ Основные функции:\n\nCombat: Продвинутое ESP с проверкой команд (Зеленые — свои, Цвет темы — враги), ХП-бары, Боксы и Подсветка (Glow).\n\nMovement: Флай (по камере), Air Walk, Noclip, изменение скорости и прыжка.\n\nFun/Exploits: TP Fling (разнос), SpinBot, Fake Lag и Ghost Invisible (невидимость).\n\nWorld: Телепорты к игрокам и система Вейппоинтов (точек).\n\n💎 Скрытые фишки и управление:\n\n⚡ Регулировка скорости колесиком:\n\nКогда включен Fly, зажмите Left Ctrl и крутите колесико мыши.\n\nЭто меняет скорость полета (±3 за прокрутку) и блокирует зум камеры. Ползунок в меню обновляется синхронно!\n\n⌨️ Система Биндов:\n\nНажмите ПКМ (Правая кнопка мыши) на любой переключатель, чтобы назначить клавишу.\n\nПКМ + Backspace чтобы удалить бинд.\n\n📍 Бинды на Телепорты:\n\nВы можете назначить клавишу на конкретную сохраненную точку (Waypoint). Просто нажмите ПКМ на кнопку [...] рядом с точкой.","tags":["hub","universalhub","universal","sehub","menu"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/VWrrde3M","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67a8b694544b235c4617e2c7","username":"semakind603","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/743e62b37c938a4c6cfddac5e58b15283cee1c7baf848c35dd2e415a2bd8b22a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67a8b694544b235c4617e2c7-1767978640327.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":